==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fr}} {{term|nacarat|lang=fr}}, from {{etyl|es}} or {{etyl|pt}} {{term|nacarado|lang=es}}, from {{etyl|ar}} {{term|نقارة|sc=Arab|tr=naqqāra||small drum}} from {{term|نقر|sc=Arab|tr=náqara||to hollow out}}. Related to the word ''[[nacre]]''.

===Noun===
